`comment("DETECTION: CloudTrail tampering
Severity: CRITICAL
Why: Attackers stop or delete trails to blind the account before acting
(CloudAudit check CT_003 finds the stopped state; this catches the act).
MITRE ATT&CK: T1562.008 (Impair Defenses: Disable or Modify Cloud Logs)
Runbook: detections/runbooks/cloudtrail_tampering.md")`

index=aws sourcetype="aws:cloudtrail"
    eventName IN (StopLogging, DeleteTrail, UpdateTrail, PutEventSelectors)
| table _time eventName userIdentity.arn requestParameters.name
        sourceIPAddress userAgent
| sort - _time
